@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Graderate System

[*] --> WaitingState

state "Waiting State" as WaitingState
WaitingState : entry / rate is waiting for start date
WaitingState : do / check if current date equals or surpasses start date
WaitingState : exit / activate rate if condition met

WaitingState --> ActiveState : [start date reached]

state "Active State" as ActiveState
ActiveState : entry / rate is active and valid
ActiveState : do / maintain active state until end of validity period
ActiveState : exit / mark rate as expired when finish date is reached

ActiveState --> ExpiredState : [finish date reached]

state "Expired State" as ExpiredState
ExpiredState : entry / rate has expired
ExpiredState : do / remove or archive rate after one year from expiration date
ExpiredState : exit / final state, no further transitions

ExpiredState --> [*] : [rate removed or archived]
@enduml
